---
import { url } from "../../lib/url";
import "../../styles/rov.css";

// The ROV's full dive, on the homepage: scroll takes it
// from the surface to 30 m (src/scripts/deepDive.ts drives the depth gauge,
// water colour, captions and footage, and lazy-loads the 3D scene from
// src/scripts/descentScene.ts). Extra attributes go on the section.
---

<section class="d-dive" id="dive" aria-labelledby="dive-title" {...Astro.props}>
	<video class="d-dive__deep" id="d-deepbg" poster={url("/media/rov-deep.jpg")} muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-hidden="true">
		<source src={url("/media/rov-deep.webm")} type="video/webm; codecs=av01.0.04M.08" />
		<source src={url("/media/rov-deep.mp4")} type="video/mp4" />
	</video>
	<div class="d-dive__layout">
		<div class="d-dive__story">
			<section class="d-sec" data-depth="0" data-cap="At the surface">
				<h2 id="dive-title">The full dive</h2>
			</section>

			<section class="d-sec" data-depth="5" data-cap="LEDs switch on automatically in the dark">
				<h3>Six thrusters, a camera and two lights</h3>
				<p class="d-muted">
					An operator on the surface drives the ROV with a controller and watches its camera on
					a laptop. Under the clear acrylic covers on the front sit the IP camera and two LEDs,
					which switch on by themselves once it gets dark.
				</p>
				<dl class="d-facts">
					<div><dt>Envelope (CAD)</dt><dd>716 × 550 × 120 mm</dd></div>
					<div><dt>Thrusters</dt><dd>6</dd></div>
					<div><dt>Max depth</dt><dd>30 m</dd></div>
					<div><dt>Control</dt><dd>Bluetooth controller</dd></div>
						<div><dt>Surface app</dt><dd>Python + Qt</dd></div>
						<div><dt>Thrusters</dt><dd>PID control</dd></div>
					<div><dt>Link</dt><dd>UDP over Wi-Fi + tether</dd></div>
					<div><dt>On board</dt><dd>Raspberry Pi 5 + ESP32</dd></div>
					<div><dt>Camera</dt><dd>IP camera, front centre</dd></div>
					<div><dt>Lights</dt><dd>2 LEDs, automatic</dd></div>
					<div><dt>Leak sensor</dt><dd>Our own design</dd></div>
					<div><dt>If it leaks</dt><dd>Surfaces by itself</dd></div>
				</dl>
			</section>

			<section class="d-sec" data-depth="12" data-cap="Camera · front centre, behind acrylic">
				<h3>From the controller to the thrusters</h3>
				<p class="d-muted">
					A Python/Qt app on the laptop reads the controller and sends each command as a UDP
					packet over Wi-Fi to the modem buoy, down the tether and through a switch inside the
					ROV to a Raspberry Pi 5. The Pi decodes it and passes PWM values to the ESP32 over
					serial, with PID control on the six thrusters. The camera's RTSP video rides the same
					IP network back up to the app.
				</p>
				<figure class="d-feed">
					<div class="d-feed__frame">
						<video id="d-feed" src={url("/media/rov-feed.mp4")} poster={url("/media/rov-feed.jpg")} muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="Footage from the ROV's camera: a school of fish around a structure's leg, with the tether in view"></video>
						<span class="d-feed__tag"><i></i>IP camera · on the laptop</span>
					</div>
					<figcaption class="d-muted">The ROV's own camera: fish around the legs of an offshore platform.</figcaption>
				</figure>
				<svg class="d-diagram" viewBox="0 0 340 500" role="img" aria-labelledby="d-diag-t">
					<title id="d-diag-t">Control chain: controller, Bluetooth, laptop, Wi-Fi with UDP, modem buoy, tether, network switch, Raspberry Pi 5, USB serial, ESP32, PWM, six thrusters. The IP camera connects to the switch and its video travels back up to the laptop. Sensors, including a leak sensor of our own design, feed the Raspberry Pi 5.</title>
					<defs>
						<marker id="d-arr-c" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path class="m-cmd" d="M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 Z"></path></marker>
						<marker id="d-arr-v" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path class="m-vid" d="M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 Z"></path></marker>
					</defs>
					<text class="small" x="0" y="12">SURFACE</text>
					<rect x="95" y="20" width="150" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="170" y="41" text-anchor="middle">Controller</text>
					<path class="cmd" d="M185 54 V82" marker-end="url(#d-arr-c)"></path><text class="lbl" x="196" y="72">Bluetooth</text>
					<rect x="95" y="84" width="150" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="170" y="105" text-anchor="middle">Laptop · Qt app</text>
					<path class="cmd" d="M185 118 V146" marker-end="url(#d-arr-c)"></path><text class="lbl" x="196" y="136">Wi-Fi · UDP</text>
					<path class="vid" d="M155 148 V120" marker-end="url(#d-arr-v)"></path>
					<rect x="95" y="148" width="150" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="170" y="169" text-anchor="middle">Modem buoy</text>
					<path class="waterline" d="M0 204 C 40 196, 80 212, 120 204 S 200 196, 240 204 S 320 212, 340 204"></path>
					<text class="small" x="0" y="222">UNDERWATER</text>
					<path class="cmd tether" d="M185 182 V246" marker-end="url(#d-arr-c)"></path><text class="lbl" x="196" y="232">Tether</text>
					<path class="vid" d="M155 248 V184" marker-end="url(#d-arr-v)"></path>
					<rect x="95" y="248" width="150" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="170" y="269" text-anchor="middle">Network switch</text>
					<rect x="0" y="298" width="80" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="40" y="319" text-anchor="middle">IP camera</text>
					<path class="vid" d="M40 298 V272 H93" marker-end="url(#d-arr-v)"></path>
					<path class="cmd" d="M185 282 V310" marker-end="url(#d-arr-c)"></path>
					<rect x="95" y="312" width="150" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="170" y="333" text-anchor="middle">Raspberry Pi 5</text>
					<rect x="262" y="312" width="78" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="301" y="333" text-anchor="middle">Sensors</text>
					<path class="vid solid" d="M262 329 H247" marker-end="url(#d-arr-v)"></path>
					<path class="cmd" d="M185 346 V374" marker-end="url(#d-arr-c)"></path><text class="lbl" x="196" y="364">USB serial</text>
					<rect x="95" y="376" width="150" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="170" y="397" text-anchor="middle">ESP32</text>
					<path class="cmd" d="M185 410 V438" marker-end="url(#d-arr-c)"></path><text class="lbl" x="196" y="428">PWM</text>
					<rect x="95" y="440" width="150" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="170" y="461" text-anchor="middle">Thrusters ×6</text>
				</svg>
				<p class="d-legend"><b>Glowing</b> commands going down · <span>dashed</span> camera video going up</p>
			</section>

			<section class="d-sec" data-depth="20" data-cap="Exploded view · 6 thrusters">
				<h3>The whole chain, controller to propeller</h3>
				<div class="d-work">
					<article><h4>Surface app</h4><p>A Python/Qt desktop app reads the controller over Bluetooth, sends the operator's commands as UDP packets, and shows the live camera feed for real-time monitoring.</p></article>
					<article><h4>Network</h4><p>A modem buoy at the surface, the tether, and a switch inside the ROV make one IP network. Commands go down it and the camera's video comes back up.</p></article>
					<article><h4>Raspberry Pi 5</h4><p>Receives the UDP commands, decodes them, and sends PWM values to the ESP32 over USB serial.</p></article>
					<article><h4>ESP32</h4><p>Turns those values into the PWM signals that drive the six thrusters, with PID control and automatic motion functions.</p></article>
					<article><h4>Leak sensor</h4><p>A sensor of our own design watches for water inside the hull. It reports to the Raspberry Pi 5, and on a leak the ROV surfaces by itself: a fail-safe that brings it home.</p></article>
				</div>
			</section>
		</div>

		<div class="d-dive__stagecol" aria-hidden="true">
			<div class="d-stage" id="d-stage">
				<img class="d-stage__poster" alt="" src={url("/models/rov-poster.webp")} width="1000" height="640" loading="lazy" />
				<span class="d-stage__status" id="d-status" role="status"></span>
				<span class="d-stage__cap" id="d-cap">At the surface</span>
				<div class="d-gauge" id="d-gauge">
					<div class="d-gauge__cap">Depth</div>
					<div class="d-gauge__rail"></div>
					<div class="d-gauge__marker" id="d-g-marker"></div>
					<div class="d-gauge__read" id="d-g-read">0.0 m</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<script>
	import "../../scripts/deepDive.ts";
</script>
